issue_context.body:
Repro:

```cs
public class Point
{
    public int X { get; }

    [JsonIgnore]
    public int Y { get; }

    public Point(int x, int y = 5) => (X, Y) = (x, y);
}

string json = "{}";
var point = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<Point>(json);
Console.WriteLine(point.Y);
// Expected: 5
// Actual: 0
```

The behavior should be consistent with then the matching prop is not ignored:

```cs
public class Point
{
    public int X { get; }

    public int Y { get; }

    public Point(int x, int y = 5) => (X, Y) = (x, y);
}

string json = "{}";
var point = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<Point>(json);
Console.WriteLine(point.Y);
// Expected: 5
// Actual: 5
```

